{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarTop","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotoolbartop"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarTop\/init(title:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarTop\/body(content:)"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarTop\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarTop"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": If an item is placed in principal position, the subtitle is never displayed (whatever "},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is), because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI’s "},{"code":".principal","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" placement only replaces the inline compact bar title, not "},{"code":".navigationSubtitle()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (iOS 26+), which would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise keep rendering next to the item with no visible title next to it. The title itself is displayed only if "},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (in that case it appears below the bar, in large title mode, not inside it)."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Appearances","text":"Appearances"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With Liquid Glass \/ iOS 26+ the OS will change the rendering of the toolbar items depending to the context:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The OS can group the items of same types in one group with kind of rectangle (e.g. views with menus)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"But for buttons items they will remain isolated","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The placement of the title can be leading or centered depending to the length of the text","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The text can be truncated if there is not enough remaining space","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The OS can apply another style for the back button","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without Liquid Glass \/ iOS 18 and lower, the OS won’t change that much the style of the toolbar items, Items won’t be visually grouped."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Globaly the appearence of the * navigation bar* elements is changed by the "},{"code":"misoNavigationBarAppearance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"helper of "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that must be applyed on the root view of the "},{"code":"NavigationStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for example."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Technical-constraints","text":"Technical constraints"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To be sure for iOS 18 and lower the back buttton and text have the good color, in your main view apply the following accent color:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    struct AppMainView: View {","        var body: some View {","            ContentView()","                .accentColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","        }","    }"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Platform-considerations","text":"Platform considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is not available for watchOS, tvOS and macOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Badges-uses","text":"Badges uses"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For iOS 26 with Liquid Glass, the system badge is used because the MISO badge component does not provide a suitable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendering with the glassified effect applied on the top toolbar."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For iOS until 18 and without Liquid Glass  MISO badge component is always used."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-sample","text":"Code sample"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    ContentView()","        .toolBarTop(\"Title\",","            leadingItems: {","                MISOToolBarItem(navigation: .back())","            },","            principalItem: MISOToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"search\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Search\") { \/* Action to process *\/ },","            trailingItems: {","                MISOToolBarItem(label: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","                MISOToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"some_image\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","            }","        )"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":" helper can also be used to apply a SwiftUI toolbar configuration.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    toolBarTop(_:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Version","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.1.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 1.4.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarTop"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents14MISOToolBarTopV","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"symbolKind":"struct","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"title":"MISOToolBarTop","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarTop"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The top toolbar (aka "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"navigation bar"}]},{"type":"text","text":" on iOS and iPadOS 18 and lower) sits at the top of the screen and provides contextual information"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and controls related to the current view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It typically displays the page title, and may include navigation actions such as “Back” or “Close” as well as supplementary actions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can contain leading, principal (center, single item only), and trailing actions."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://MISOComponents/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP","type":"unresolvable","title":"SwiftUICore.ViewModifier"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOToolBarTop":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarTop"}],"title":"MISOToolBarTop","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotoolbartop","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarTop"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The top toolbar (aka "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"navigation bar","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" on iOS and iPadOS 18 and lower) sits at the top of the screen and provides contextual information"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and controls related to the current view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It typically displays the page title, and may include navigation actions such as “Back” or “Close” as well as supplementary actions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can contain leading, principal (center, single item only), and trailing actions."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarTop","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"image","alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url